      "statement": "Let K be algebraically closed, complete, and nontrivially valued; let C be a smooth proper algebraic K-curve; let W⊆Cᵃⁿ be ordinary open; and let v:W→R be continuous. If v has positive CLD Hessian current in Wanner’s Definition 3.16, then v is Thuillier-subharmonic. Wanner, arXiv:1801.04713v3, Theorem 4.7.",
