      "id": "1084f837-a67a-4f2f-8fcb-b24dde4a0bd9/12",
      "statement": "For good strict analytic spaces and a divisible coefficient subgroup Λ⊆R, Λ-PL functions pull back under analytic morphisms and complete scalar extension; Λ-piecewise linearity is equivalent on a space and its reduction. For a finite flat surjective morphism, h is Λ-PL if and only if its pullback is Λ-PL. The same equivalence holds for scalar extension to the completion of an algebraic field extension. GJR v3 Lemma 5.4, Proposition 5.11, and Corollary 5.12.",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2111.05741v3",
