      "id": "1084f837-a67a-4f2f-8fcb-b24dde4a0bd9/16",
      "statement": "For every morphism f:Y→X of analytic spaces over a complete non-Archimedean field, y↦dim_y(f) is upper semicontinuous for the analytic Zariski topology; in particular, each locus {y:dim_y(f)≥m} is Zariski closed. Ducros, Variation de la dimension relative, Theorem 4.9.",
