      "id": "1084f837-a67a-4f2f-8fcb-b24dde4a0bd9/18",
      "statement": "Let V be a paracompact strict analytic space over a complete nontrivially valued field K and L a line bundle on V. A formal metric on L restricted to a compact strict analytic domain extends to a formal metric on L; piecewise linear metrics are precisely formal metrics. If V is compact and F is the completion of an algebraic extension of K embedded in the completed algebraic closure, every piecewise linear or piecewise rational-linear metric on L_F descends to such a metric over a finite embedded subextension K′/K in F. GM Propositions 2.7, 2.10, and 2.18(b).",
